  "description": "I'm K, my daughter was raped and killed by dregs but they twisted all the truths and, in the end, my daughter became the one who's to be blamed. The police are afraid of them, the law can't control them, then I'm going to clean those dregs for good. I'm K, you are the next to be terminated! \n\nA moving and touching story about a father seeking revenge for his own daughter.\n\n(Source: MangaToon)",
